{"id":"n17173-4-10","stage":0,"title":"지내다 · 度过","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17173-4-10-1","ko":"여기서 며칠을 지낼 계획입니까?","zh":"您打算在这里住几天呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기서","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기서","audio":"/audio/507960116aed3699ca8f.mp3"}},{"text":"며칠을","meaning":"几天","explanation":"며칠：几天；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"며칠","audio":"/audio/879abb6ed1ed4d59a03e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36676","senseId":"2","lemma":"며칠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"며칠을","audio":"/audio/f5960330461ec3d76f9a.mp3"}},{"text":"지낼","meaning":"待、住","explanation":"지내다：度过一段时间；在这里指在此地待或住几天。-ㄹ 修饰后面的 계획，表示打算。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"4","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지낼","audio":"/audio/69cbd406f294d036f6c0.mp3"}},{"text":"계획입니까?","meaning":"计划，筹划","explanation":"계획：计划，筹划；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㅂ니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"계획","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23324","senseId":"1","lemma":"계획","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계획입니까","audio":"/audio/2b1f7c3ec35d46a1dc82.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"879abb6ed1ed4d59","term":"며칠","zh":"几天","audio":"/audio/879abb6ed1ed4d59a03e.mp3","entryId":"36676","definition":"几个日子。","pronunciation":["며칠"]},{"id":"d56e2e0e23cd1763","term":"지내다","zh":"度过","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3","entryId":"17173","definition":"经过一定的时间。","pronunciation":["지ː내다"]},{"